==Attempting to enter the arena before talking to Minimus==
* '''Minimus:''' Oi! Where d'you think you're going? Come and speak to me before you go wondering{{sic}} through there. You'll get yourself killed!
* {{tact|end}}

==Attempting to use the bank chest without enough Glory==
* '''Minimus:''' Oi, get yer hands off that! It's reserved for survivors of the Colosseum.
* {{tbox|You do not have enough Glory to use that.}}
* {{tact|end}}

==First time dialogue==
* '''Player:''' Hello there.
* '''Minimus:''' Welcome, Rookie.
* '''Player:''' What is this place?
* '''Minimus:''' This place...? Why, This is the great Fortis Colosseum!
* '''Minimus:''' Adventurers come from near and far to test their might within these walls.
* '''Player:''' That sounds exciting!
* '''Minimus:''' Indeed it is. If you are victorious in the Colosseum, the whole of Varlamore shall hear of your name.
* '''Player:''' I imagine its{{sic}} quite the challenge then?
* '''Minimus:''' It'll put your skills to the test alright.
* '''Player:''' How do I participate?
* '''Minimus:''' Just head through that tunnel behind me and we'll get the show started! Make sure you've got everything you need. Once you're in you can't leave until the end of a wave!
* '''Minimus:''' Come and ask if you have any other questions.
* {{tselect|Select an Option}}
* {{topt|Can you tell me about modifiers?}}
** '''Player:''' Can you tell me about modifiers?
** '''Minimus:''' Yes! After all, they were my idea...
** '''Player:''' Oh...
** '''Minimus:''' Every time you complete a wave, I'll offer you a choice of three modifiers.
** '''Minimus:''' Each modifier will increase the challenge for the rest of the run - So choose wisely!
** '''Minimus:''' Some modifiers can be offered multiple times, with the effects then growing in power!
** '''Player:''' Thanks for the heads up!
** '''Minimus:''' Was there anything else?
** {{tact|previous}}
* {{topt|How do I get rewarded?}}
** '''Player:''' How do I get rewarded?
** '''Minimus:''' Well it's a bit different to just killing monsters and picking up items, as I'm sure you're used to...
** '''Player:''' How so?
** '''Minimus:''' After each wave inside the Colosseum, I'll show you the rewards you have earned, as well as what you'll earn from the next wave...
** '''Minimus:''' If you aren't confident that you can complete the next wave, you can claim your existing rewards and exit early.
** '''Minimus:''' However, if you're confident you can beat the next wave, you can risk your whole reward pile to get even more!
** '''Minimus:''' Be careful though. If you die or leave the arena before claiming your loot from me, you will lose all of the rewards you've earned.
** '''Player:''' So I'm guessing the higher the wave, the better the rewards?
** '''Minimus:''' Oh, you're good. Exactly that!
** '''Minimus:''' Even better - if you manage to finish all of the waves and the final challenge, then you'll be awarded with Dizana's Quiver.
** '''Minimus:''' It's a handy piece of kit that you wear on your back to store extra bolts or arrows.
** '''Player:''' That does sound handy! Thanks for explaining all of that.
** '''Minimus:''' Anytime, Rookie. Anything else?
** {{tact|previous}}
* {{topt|What is Glory?}}
** '''Player:''' What is Glory?
** '''Minimus:''' It's the measure of your progress inside the Colosseum.
** '''Minimus:''' Speak to Gloria over there if you want to know the details.
** '''Player:''' Thanks.
** {{tact|previous}}
* {{topt|What do you do around here?}}
** '''Player:''' What do you do around here?
** '''Minimus:''' I'm Minimus. It's not my real name of course, but it seems to have stuck. I started out competing here as a gladiator when I was a young'n. After that I became one of the lanistas.
** '''Player:''' Lanistas?
** '''Minimus:''' The ones responsible for overseeing the selecting and training of the gladiators.
** '''Minimus:''' Eventually, the kingdom gave me the role of Colosseum Master. I still make sure to fit some fighting in, but now I have the honor{{sic}} of managing the fights themselves.
** '''Player:''' So are you not training like the rest of the gladiators?
** '''Minimus:''' I have no need! I'm already one of the greatest fighters to grace this arena.
** '''Player:''' Are you at a disadvantage because of your height?
** '''Minimus:''' No! How dare you even suggest that! Those spindly human bodies are unfit to go toe to toe with a fine dwarf like myself!
** '''Minimus:''' Now, did you need anything else?
** {{tact|previous}}
* {{topt|Goodbye.}}
** '''Player:''' Goodbye.
** '''Minimus:''' Farewell, Rookie.
** {{tact|end}}

